187
00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:01.970
Jen Salata.

188
00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:03.650
Applause for Jen!

189
00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:04.190
Oh,

190
00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:04.630
Jen.

191
00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:05.610
Jen,

192
00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:08.130
so many good lines in this.

193
00:08:08.430 --> 00:08:09.810
I reached out to Jen

194
00:08:09.810 --> 00:08:12.310
