198
00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:18.450
My biggest memory

199
00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:19.310
about writing the duel

200
00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.450
was how little I had

201
00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:21.230
when I was sent off

202
00:08:21.230 --> 00:08:21.970
to write the script.

203
00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:23.830
It was mid-season five

204
00:08:23.830 --> 00:08:24.950
and it was a really busy patch

205
00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:25.590
for the writers,

206
00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:26.550
for all of us.

207
00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:27.830
And I remember this episode

208
00:08:27.830 --> 00:08:28.510
had to be written

209
00:08:28.510 --> 00:08:28.990
really,

210
00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:29.770
really quickly.

211
00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:31.330
And I knew it was about

212
00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:32.210
Andy finding out

213
00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:33.550
about Angela and Dwight's affair.

214
00:08:34.190 --> 00:08:35.110
But where we'd usually

215
00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:36.110
spend time as a group

216
00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:37.190
fleshing out the story,

217
00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:38.890
I went off on this script

218
00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:39.630
with a sentence.

219
00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:41.510
Andy runs over Dwight

220
00:08:41.510 --> 00:08:42.130
in his Prius,

221
00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:42.790
keeping it under

222
00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:43.750
five miles an hour

223
00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:44.570
so Dwight doesn't

224
00:08:44.570 --> 00:08:45.150
hear him coming.

225
00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:46.070
I mean,

226
00:08:46.150 --> 00:08:46.990
it was a good sentence,

227
00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:48.230
but there was a lot

228
00:08:48.230 --> 00:08:48.910
to fill in.

229
00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:49.930
That was it.

230
00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:50.970
She had a sentence.

231
00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:52.250
And she crafted

232
00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:53.550
this amazing story.

233
00:08:53.810 --> 00:08:54.150
Yes.

234
00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:55.850
Why Andy was going to

235
00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:56.990
run over Dwight slowly

236
00:08:56.990 --> 00:08:57.750
with a Prius,

237
00:08:58.270 --> 00:08:59.290
she didn't know.

238
00:08:59.570 --> 00:09:00.450
She just knew

239
00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:01.350
that was going to happen

240
00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:01.950
in the episode.

241
00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:02.830
And this is what

242
00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:03.770
she came up with.

243
00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:04.890
She had to build

244
00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:05.630
to that moment.

245
00:09:05.930 --> 00:09:07.350
Because usually

246
00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:08.150
they would get

247
00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:08.990
whole outlines.

248
00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:10.530
They would have

249
00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:11.230
an A plot,

250
00:09:11.390 --> 00:09:12.070
a B plot,

251
00:09:12.310 --> 00:09:12.770
all of it.

252
00:09:13.130 --> 00:09:13.550
No.

253
00:09:13.970 --> 00:09:14.530
Amazing.

254
00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:15.330
Jen Salata,

255
00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:15.830
again.

256
00:09:16.190 --> 00:09:17.210
Applause, Jen.

257
00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:17.690
Amazing.

258
00:09:18.810 --> 00:09:20.270
Fast fact number two,

259
00:09:20.590 --> 00:09:21.310
this episode

260
00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:21.930
was directed

261
