alongside Dave Rogers.

265
00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:28.410
We love Dean.

266
00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:29.570
We love Dean,

267
00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:30.730
and he knew the show

268
00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:31.590
so well,

269
00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:32.410
much like Dave.

270
00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:34.310
They knew every moment.

271
00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:34.990
Oh, yeah.

272
00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:36.150
Dean told me

273
00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:37.310
that he had directed

274
00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:38.350
